<newsitem itemid="44905" id="root" date="1996-09-10" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Peptide first half pretax loss edges wider.</title>
<headline>Peptide first half pretax loss edges wider.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.2 loss	     vs 10.1 loss</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.78 loss	    vs 1.65 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   0.04		   vs 0.12</p>
<p> Operating result	 2.57 loss	    vs 1.68 loss</p>
<p> Interest receivable    0.80		   vs 0.03</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.01		   vs 0.01</p>
<p> Tax			  nil		    vs 0.01</p>
<p> Net taxed		  1.78		   vs 1.66</p>
<p>Note - Biopharmaceutical development company Peptide Therapeutics Group Plc said development of its leading product, the Active Allergy Vaccine, continues on track. In a separate statement, Peptide said it had won a grant worth 450,000 stg to be used in the Active Allergy Vaccine development from Britain's Department of Trade and Industry.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
